  "title": "Custom Christian Floral Cross Area Rug, Non-Skid, Church Decor",
  "handle": "custom-christian-floral-cross-area-rug-non-skid-church-decor",
  "description": "<p>This inspirational faith floral area rug offers a unique blend of comfort and spirituality for your home. Featuring a customizable design, it serves as a meaningful centerpiece in various settings. Its thoughtful construction enhances both the aesthetic and spiritual atmosphere of any room.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a Christian faith floral design for an inspirational touch.</li>\n<li>Personalize with a name or special message for a unique gift.</li>\n<li>Soft polyester fabric provides comfort underfoot.</li>\n<li>Equipped with an anti-slip backing for enhanced safety.</li>\n<li>Suitable for a variety of home and church uses.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Bedroom, Living Room, Office, Gamer Room, Reading Nook, Church</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Non-Skid</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Floral</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Christian, Faith</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam, Polyester Fabric</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Cotton Blend, Anti-slip</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Wrinkle-resistant, Fade-resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Vacuum for quick cleaning, Machine wash for deeper care</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile area rug is ideal for enhancing spiritual and interior atmospheres in entryways, bedrooms, living rooms, offices, gamer rooms, cozy reading nooks, or as a decorative piece in a church setting. It also functions perfectly as a prayer rug or meditation corner rug.</p>",
